se from happening  and if people don't trust me by now and  don't want to support this tissue  repository then I don't know who will  all I can say is as long as there is one  breath left in my body I will keep  saying the same thing and trying to work  as hard as ever for my patients I can't  think of a better place to end up than  that that was very eloquently said dr.  Alver Rosa thanks so much for being on  the mindscape podcast Thank You Sean it  has been an honor being on your podcast  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

